{
  "candidateCarrier": {
    "default": "native"
  },
  "description": "add-surface 使用 global owner + create parent:course-locations append，创建 Slide/Flow/Spatial 表面及起始页。后续内容用 created-scope 指向返回位置的默认 owner。其余操作用当前课程位置的正式 update target。",
  "examples": [
    {
      "bindings": "values 的 surfaceType 来自当前观察、已读资源或用户要求，值须满足本卡 inputSchema；destination 原样复制当前目标。",
      "code": "const input={\"operation\":\"add-surface\",\"surfaceType\":values[\"surfaceType\"]}; const receipt=await session.execute(\"course.navigation\",input,destination);",
      "operation": "add-surface"
    },
    {
      "bindings": "values 的 title 来自当前观察、已读资源或用户要求，值须满足本卡 inputSchema；destination 原样复制当前目标。",
      "code": "const input={\"operation\":\"rename-location\",\"title\":values[\"title\"]}; const receipt=await session.execute(\"course.navigation\",input,destination);",
      "operation": "rename-location"
    },
    {
      "bindings": "values 的  来自当前观察、已读资源或用户要求，值须满足本卡 inputSchema；destination 原样复制当前目标。",
      "code": "const input={\"operation\":\"delete-location\"}; const receipt=await session.execute(\"course.navigation\",input,destination);",
      "operation": "delete-location"
    },
    {
      "bindings": "values 的 surfaceIds 来自当前观察、已读资源或用户要求，值须满足本卡 inputSchema；destination 原样复制当前目标。",
      "code": "const input={\"operation\":\"reorder-surfaces\",\"surfaceIds\":values[\"surfaceIds\"]}; const receipt=await session.execute(\"course.navigation\",input,destination);",
      "operation": "reorder-surfaces"
    }
  ],
  "inputSchema": {
    "$defs": {
      "__schema0": {
        "maxLength": 120,
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "__schema1": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "oneOf": [
      {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "operation": {
            "const": "add-surface",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "surfaceType": {
            "enum": [
              "slide",
              "flow",
              "spatial-2d"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema0"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "operation",
          "surfaceType"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "operation": {
            "const": "rename-location",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema0"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "operation",
          "title"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "operation": {
            "const": "delete-location",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "operation"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "operation": {
            "const": "reorder-surfaces",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "surfaceIds": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema1"
            },
            "minItems": 1,
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "operation",
          "surfaceIds"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      }
    ]
  },
  "invocation": "Builder: await session.execute(tool,input,destination)。input 遵循本卡完整 Schema；destination 原样使用当前 observe/createScope 的目标；只以 committed receipt 判定成功。",
  "name": "course.navigation",
  "recovery": "invalid-input: 按本卡 Schema 修正字段；revision-conflict: 重新 observe 后复制新 target 和源码基线；tool-failed: 读取 diagnostics 修复所指输入/资源/宿主条件，失败不代表已提交。",
  "support": "conditional-on-input-target-resources-and-host",
  "supportedScopes": [
    "slide:global",
    "flow:global",
    "spatial-2d:global"
  ],
  "variants": [
    {
      "operation": "add-surface",
      "scopes": [
        "slide:global",
        "flow:global",
        "spatial-2d:global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "operation": "rename-location",
      "scopes": [
        "slide:global",
        "flow:global",
        "spatial-2d:global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "operation": "delete-location",
      "scopes": [
        "slide:global",
        "flow:global",
        "spatial-2d:global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "operation": "reorder-surfaces",
      "scopes": [
        "slide:global",
        "flow:global",
        "spatial-2d:global"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "version": 1
}
